      <link>https://campbellsvilletigers.com/news/2026/2/11/mens-wrestling-tigers-stay-naia-8-headed-into-the-postseason.aspx</link>
      <description>KANSAS CITY, Mo. – The Campbellsville University men's wrestling team held steady at #8 in the final regular-season edition of the NAIA Men's Wrestling Coaches' Top 25 Poll, released Wednesday by the national office. The Tigers accumulated 144 team points, finishing just one point behind Mid-South Conference rival #7 Cumberlands (Ky.).</description>
